---
// BeP02MethodMatrix: added in the figure pass. Red = the part the reader owns or the failing path.
---
<figure class="bep2h">
  <div class="bep2h-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 262" role="img" aria-label="Which methods are safe and idempotent. GET is safe and idempotent. PUT and DELETE are idempotent but not safe. POST is neither, so every delivery creates a new thing.">
<text x="20" y="22" class="tt"><tspan data-lang-en>method</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>method</tspan></text>
<text x="180" y="22" text-anchor="middle" class="tt"><tspan data-lang-en>safe</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>safe</tspan></text>
<text x="300" y="22" text-anchor="middle" class="tt"><tspan data-lang-en>idempotent</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>idempotent</tspan></text>
<text x="400" y="22" class="tt"><tspan data-lang-en>what a retry may assume</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>retry được phép giả định gì</tspan></text>
<line x1="20" y1="36" x2="880" y2="36" class="ln" style="opacity:.35" />
<text x="20" y="67" class="bb">GET</text>
<circle cx="180" cy="62" r="13" class="box" /><path d="M 174 62 L 179 67 L 187 57" class="ok" />
<circle cx="300" cy="62" r="13" class="box" /><path d="M 294 62 L 299 67 L 307 57" class="ok" />
<text x="400" y="67" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>retry as often as you like</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>retry bao nhiêu lần cũng được</tspan></text>
<line x1="20" y1="88" x2="880" y2="88" class="ln" style="opacity:.35" />
<text x="20" y="119" class="bb">PUT</text>
<circle cx="180" cy="114" r="13" class="box" /><path d="M 175 114 L 185 114" class="ok" />
<circle cx="300" cy="114" r="13" class="box" /><path d="M 294 114 L 299 119 L 307 109" class="ok" />
<text x="400" y="119" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>retry freely — same state left behind</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>retry thoải mái — trạng thái để lại như nhau</tspan></text>
<line x1="20" y1="140" x2="880" y2="140" class="ln" style="opacity:.35" />
<text x="20" y="171" class="bb">DELETE</text>
<circle cx="180" cy="166" r="13" class="box" /><path d="M 175 166 L 185 166" class="ok" />
<circle cx="300" cy="166" r="13" class="box" /><path d="M 294 166 L 299 171 L 307 161" class="ok" />
<text x="400" y="171" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>retry freely — the answer may differ, the state does not</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>retry thoải mái — câu trả lời có thể khác, trạng thái thì không</tspan></text>
<line x1="20" y1="192" x2="880" y2="192" class="ln" style="opacity:.35" />
<text x="20" y="223" class="r">POST</text>
<circle cx="180" cy="218" r="13" class="box" /><path d="M 175 218 L 185 218" class="ok" />
<circle cx="300" cy="218" r="13" class="boxr" /><path d="M 295 213 L 305 223 M 295 223 L 305 213" class="xr" />
<text x="400" y="223" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>every delivery creates a new thing</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mỗi lần giao hàng tạo một thứ mới</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>What the spec lets a retry assume, verb by verb. Only POST has neither promise, which is why it is the verb that needs help.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Spec cho phép retry giả định gì, từng verb một. Chỉ POST không có lời hứa nào, nên nó là verb cần được giúp.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep2h { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep2h-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep2h svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep2h text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep2h .tt { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14px; }
  .bep2h .b { fill: var(--text-body); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep2h .bb { fill: var(--text); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
  .bep2h .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep2h .f { fill: var(--text-faint); font-size: 12px; }
  .bep2h .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep2h .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep2h .boxr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .bep2h .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .bep2h .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .bep2h .d { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .bep2h .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep2h .hdr { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep2h .xr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.2; fill: none; }
  .bep2h .ok { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 2.2; fill: none; }
  .bep2h .band { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep2h .bandr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .bep2h .dot { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep2h .dotr { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep2h figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
